# {{.Slug}}

Human-in-loop approval workflow: Step → AwaitSignal → Step. The signal
URL is embedded in the approval email so the approver hits POST
`/signal/<token>` to resume the run with their decision.

Generated by `reactor new approval-flow {{.Slug}}` on {{.Date}}.

The signal payload shape is `{"approved": bool, "comment": "..."}`.
Approved → second step runs; rejected → workflow exits cleanly.
